 file \"BASELINE.html\".", "date": "2026-08-18T23:24:00"}], "hubs": ["top-rated-pages-this-month", "news"], "images": ["https://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/billiths-proposal-ii/preview.png"], "link": "billiths-proposal-ii", "page_id": "1469046829", "rating": 144, "raw_content": "<html><body><div id=\"page-content\">\n<p><iframe src=\"//interwiki.scpwiki.com/styleFrame.html?priority=1&amp;theme=https://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--code/theme%3Ay2k/1&amp;css={$css}\" style=\"display: none\"></iframe></p>\n\n<div class=\"preview\">\n<p>Due to the adaptive mesh which lines this chamber, it is currently the only space where reality behaves as it did prior to SCP-001.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"u-cromthumbnail\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"scp-image-block block-center\" style=\"width:100%;\"><img alt=\"preview.png\" class=\"image\" src=\"https://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/billiths-proposal-ii/preview.png\"/>\n<div class=\"scp-image-caption\">\n<p>BASELINE</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"creditRate\">\n<li class=\"rateBox folded\">\n<div class=\"rate-box-with-credit-button\">\n<div class=\"creditButton foldable-list-container\">\n<p><a href=\"javascript:;\">\uf129</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"u-credit-view\">\n<div class=\"fader foldable-list-container\"><a href=\"javascript:;\">close</a></div>\n<div class=\"modalcontainer\">\n<div class=\"modalbox\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<h2><span>Info</span></h2>\n</div>\n<hr/>\n<div class=\"close-credits foldable-list-container\"><a href=\"javascript:;\">X</a></div>\n<div class=\"credit first\">\n<p><strong>SCP-001:</strong> <strong>BASELINE</strong><br/>\n<strong>Author:</strong> <span class=\"printuser avatarhover\"><a href=\"http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/billith\" onclick=\"WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3042342); return false;\"><img alt=\"Billith\" class=\"small\" src=\"https://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3042342&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1787095479\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3042342)\"/></a><a href=\"http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/billith\" onclick=\"WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3042342); return false;\">Billith</a></span><br/>\n<strong>Read More:</strong> <a href=\"/sr-researcher-james-a-harkness-personnel-file\">Personnel File</a></p>\n</div>\n<hr/>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-001</p>\n<p><strong>Object Class:</strong> Uncontained</p>\n<p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> SCP-001 appears to exist everywhere aside from Adaptive Observation Chamber C of Site-15. The sole inhabitant of this chamber, Dr. Arthur Silas (self), is currently tasked with containing SCP-001, somehow.</p>\n<p>Due to the adaptive mesh which lines this chamber, the space within is currently the only space where reality behaves as it did prior to SCP-001.</p>\n<p>Thus, the adaptive mesh <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">must not be perforated at any time.</span></p>\n<p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-001 is a CK-Class Reality Restructuring event that occured on 08/14/1996 at 0310 PST. That was yesterday, aka Day Zero.</p>\n<p>The exact details of SCP-001 are unknown; immediately following the event, a Broken Masquerade was triggered, leading to a complete abandonment of Foundation operations as they were previously understood.</p>\n<p>I am the only one who remains fully myself, having been inside the Adaptive Chamber at the time of the event. This is my cross to bear for staying late.</p>\n<p>Everyone else has been changed. They have become twisted amalgamations of their previous selves mixed with the inhabitants of another reality. The world outside no longer follows the rules that once made sense. I am alone, and this room is the final place where reality is truly real.</p>\n<p>I am Dr. Arthur Silas, last of the old world, and today is <strong><a href=\"https://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/billiths-proposal-ii/BASELINE.html\">Day One</a></strong>.<br/>\n<span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> </span><br/>\n<span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> </span><br/>\n<span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> </span><br/>\n<span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> </span><br/>\n<span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> </span><br/>\n<span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> </span></p>\n<div class=\"licensebox\">\n<div class=\"collapsible-block\">\n<div class=\"collapsible-block-folded\"><a class=\"collapsible-block-link\" href=\"javascript:;\">\u2021\u00a0Licensing\u00a0/\u00a0Citation</a></div>\n<div class=\"collapsible-block-unfolded\" style=\"display:none\">\n<div class=\"collapsible-block-unfolded-link\"><a class=\"collapsible-block-link\" href=\"javascript:;\">\u2021\u00a0Hide\u00a0Licensing\u00a0/\u00a0Citation</a></div>\n<div class=\"collapsible-block-content\">\n<p>Cite this page as:</p>\n<div class=\"list-pages-box\"> <div class=\"list-pages-item\">\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"<a href=\"/billiths-proposal-ii\">Billith's Proposal II</a>\" by Billith, from the <a href=\"https://scpwiki.com\">SCP Wiki</a>. Source: <a href=\"https://scpwiki.com/billiths-proposal-ii\">https://scpwiki.com/billiths-proposal-ii</a>. Licensed under <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/\">CC BY-SA</a>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>For information on how to use this component, see the <a href=\"/component:license-box\">License Box component</a>. To read about licensing policy, see the <a href=\"/licensing-guide\">Licensing Guide</a>.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Filename:</strong> 13593.png<br/>\n<strong>Author:</strong> <span class=\"printuser avatarhover\"><a href=\"http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/billith\" onclick=\"WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3042342); return false;\"><img alt=\"Billith\" class=\"small\" src=\"https://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3042342&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1787095479\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=30423